Hi All,
	We would like you all to note that an updated specification (Rev 1.0 update)
of Intel® virtualization technology for Directed I/O is now available on
Intel web site:
([1] http://download.intel.com/technology/computing/vptech/Intel(r)_VT_for_Direct_IO.pdf ).

	I will be updating the initial patches patches which Ashok Raj posted here
http://lkml.org/lkml/2007/4/24/231 with all the feedback incorported and
will be re-submitting them soon.


	The  specification update includes DMA remapping capability, Interrupt
remapping  capability,  queue management, invalidation information and
enhancements.


